DESCRIPTION:Fatherland\n(20.2 ↗︎)\n\nDrame\, Histoire\n𝟭𝗵𝟮𝟮
 \n\nPoland\, Germany\, France\, Italy\, United Kingdom\n(Polish\, German\,
  English)\n\n𝗥𝗲𝗮𝗹𝗶𝘀𝗮𝘁𝗲𝘂𝗿 : Paweł Pawliko
 wski\n𝗦𝗰𝗲𝗻𝗮𝗿𝗶𝗼 : Paweł Pawlikowski\, Hendrik Hand
 loegten\n𝗣𝗵𝗼𝘁𝗼𝗴𝗿𝗮𝗽𝗵𝗶𝗲 : Łukasz Żal\n
 𝗣𝗿𝗼𝗱𝘂𝗰𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 : Our Films\, Extreme Emotions\, 
 Nine Hours\n\n𝗔𝗰𝘁𝗲𝘂𝗿𝘀 :\n- Sandra Hüller\n- Hanns Zi
